    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sounds, improvise grooves, and evolve the soundtrack in a <strong>procedural music-driven world</strong> where every move is part of the song. Astral Planes is a music-based physics-driven game where gameplay isn't just synced to music-- it<i> is</i>\u00a0the music. As you navigate obstacles and collect notes, you'll generate a live, interactive soundtrack with every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rhythm game without a script - you aren't matching anything - you're creating. Select a plane and feel the vibe, with or without friends. Every note you collect is added to an evolving loop. The music changes as you play, leading to unexpected grooves. Every session is unique.\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sounds, improvise grooves, and evolve the soundtrack in a <strong>procedural music-driven world</strong> where every move is part of the song. Astral Planes is a music-based physics-driven game where gameplay isn't just synced to music-- it<i> is</i>\u00a0the music. As you navigate obstacles and collect notes, you'll generate a live, interactive soundtrack with every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rhythm game without a script - you aren't matching anything - you're creating. Select a plane and feel the vibe, with or without friends. Every note you collect is added to an evolving loop. The music changes as you play, leading to unexpected grooves. Every session is unique.\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "A rhythm game where you don\u2019t just follow the beat\u2014you create it. Collect sounds, improvise grooves, and evolve the soundtrack in a procedural music-driven world where every move is part of the song.",
